  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The purpose of the data is to determine a baseline for the frequency of occurrence (%FO) of plastic ingestion by arctic char in an area where the fish is an important food source. Findings can also be used to characterize the types and potentially the sources of marine, freshwater, and terrestrial plastic pollution in the area, so that mitigation measure can be considered."
